# demo_tkinter_instead_of_imshow Specification

## Overview

`demo_tkinter_instead_of_imshow` demonstrates using Tkinter instead of OpenCV's imshow for display.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_tkinter_instead_of_imshow.py
```

## Features

- Tkinter-based frame display
- Alternative to cv2.imshow
- GUI-based video display

## Exit

- Close window to exit
